      "properties": {
        "Node name for S&R": "MarkdownNote"
      },
      "widgets_values": [
        "# 03 · A file that already has separate tracks (mov / mka)\nWith **speakers_from = tracks of the file** nothing is analysed: the track chosen by *track_index* (usually 0, the full dialogue) becomes `timeline`, and the file's *other* tracks come out as `speaker_1`, `speaker_2`… as they are. All tracks are shown as lanes, so you see at a glance what the file contains. The sections you mark apply to every track, so they stay in step.\n\n*Channels are not tracks:* a multichannel WAV is one track. Audio with more than two channels is mixed to mono (ComfyUI's own audio nodes play such audio too slow); *multichannel = keep all channels* (advanced) leaves it as is."
      ],
      "color": "#432",
      "bgcolor": "#653"
    },
